# Git LFS — binary assets the BUILT sites need at deploy time.
#
# AUDIO REMOVED FROM THIS REPO 2026-08-31. The 100 .m4a teaching files (345 MB) were
# archived to ~/Psychiatry-Clerkship-Audio-Archive/ (verified byte-identical, SHA-256,
# all 100) and untracked here. Reason: the GitHub LFS budget was exhausted, which broke
# deploys on ALL THREE Netlify sites — including sp-interview-proxy, which serves no
# media whatsoever. Every uncached deploy re-downloaded 455 MB of LFS objects; the audio
# was 345 MB of it.
#
# Audio extensions are now in .gitignore so they cannot be re-added by accident. To
# restore, see the README in the archive folder. The better fix is object storage +
# URL references, which removes the deploy-time requirement these lines existed for.
#
# Video (.mp4, 110 MB, 6 files) is still tracked — the orientation video and the
# video-library reels are shipped by build_deploy.py.
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Normalize line endings for text (belt-and-suspenders with core.autocrlf=false).
*.md   text
*.html text
*.py   text
*.json text
